* TPD       116 12181    FAP FOR FORTRANS READ,WRITE TAPE               TPD 0001
*      FAP                                                              TPD00002
*NUTPD  N.Y.U. SUBROUTINE.  A FAP PROGRAM WHICH,WHEN USED BY A FAP      TPD00003
*              ROUTINE THROUGH THE USE OF THE CALL PSEUDO-OP MAKES      TPD00004
*              FORTRAN SUBROUTINES AVAILABLE FOR READING AN INPUT TAPE  TPD00005
*              AND WRITING OUTPUT TAPE.  THE TWO ENTRIES ARE            TPD00006
*      1. CALL NUWAT,T,F,W1,S1,W2,S2,.....,WN,SN    (WRITE A TAPE)      TPD00007
*      2. CALL NURAT,T,F,R1,S1,R2,S2,.....,RN,SN    (READ A TAPE)       TPD00008
*      WHERE   T  IS THE TAPE NUMBER, SUCH AS 2,4,8,ETC.                TPD00009
*              F   IS THE LOCATION OF THE FORMAT (STORED FOWARDS)       TPD00010
*              W  ARE THE ITEMS TO BE WRITTEN ON TAPE                   TPD00011
*              R   ARE THE ITEMS TO BE READ FROM TAPE                   TPD00012
*              S  ARE THE SUCCESSIVE NUMBERS OF W (OR R) ITEMS  AFFECTEDTPD00013
*      SPECIAL NOTE... THIS ROUTINE (WITH THE SAME ENTRY POINT NAMES) ISTPD00014
*              ALREADY A PART OF NUSNUP, A LARGER SUB-ROUINE WHICH      TPD00015
*              PROVIDES ENTRIES TO PERFORM ALL FORTRAN I/O OPERATIONS.  TPD00016
       COUNT   93                                                       TPD00017
       ENTRY   NURAT             TO READ A TAPE (DECIMAL)               TPD00018
       ENTRY   NUWAT             TO WRITE A TAPE (DECIMAL)              TPD00019
*      ***    IF STANDARD ERROR PROCEDURE NOT IN SYSTEM MAKE THIS A PZE TPD00020
*      ***   AND MAKE THIS  A    BCI  1,NUTPD                           TPD00021
 NURAT CAL     ATSLI             A TSX (SLI),4                          TPD00022
       SLW     TOSLR                                                    TPD00023
       CAL     ATRTN         TSX RTN,4                                  TPD00024
       SLW     RESTOR+1                                                 TPD00025
       CAL     ATTSH         TSX TSH,4                                  TPD00026
       SLW     TOCALL                                                   TPD00027
       TRA     SAVER                                                    TPD00028
 NUWAT CAL     ATSLO             A TSX  (SLO),4                         TPD00029
       SLW     TOSLR                                                    TPD00030
       CAL     ATFIL         TSX FIL,4                                  TPD00031
       SLW     RESTOR+1                                                 TPD00032
       CAL     ATSTH         TSX STH,4                                  TPD00033
       SLW     TOCALL                                                   TPD00034
 SAVER SXA     SAV2,2                                                   TPD00035
       SXA     SAV1,1                                                   TPD00036
       AXT     SAVER,1                                                  TPD00037
       SXD     NURAT-2,4                                                TPD00038
       LXD     NURAT-2,2                                                TPD00039
       CLA     ANOP         FOR INITIAL ENTRY CONDITIONS                TPD00040
       STO     TOCALL-1                                                 TPD00041
       CLA     1,2           TAPE NUMBER                                TPD00042
       ALS     18                                                       TPD00043
       STO     TAPNU                                                    TPD00044
       CLA     2,2           LOC. OF FORMAT STATEMENT                   TPD00045
*                                        TOOK OUT A STA ONEDC           TPD00046
*                                        TOOK OUT A CLA ONEDC           TPD00047
       STO     LCFOR                                                    TPD00048
 TNARG CAL     3,2           LOC OF ARRAY                               TPD00049
       ARS     15                                                       TPD00050
       LAS     ATSXZ         IS NEXT ARG A TSX WITH A TAG 3F ZER3       TPD00051
 TREST TRA     RESTOR                                                   TPD00052
       TRA     *+2                                                      TPD00053
       TRA     RESTOR        NO                                         TPD00054
       CLA     3,2           LOC OF  ARRAY                              TPD00055
       ADD     AONE          ADD A ONE FOR FORTRAN ROUTINES             TPD00056
       STA     LCARY                                                    TPD00057
 AGAIN CAL     4,2           NO OF ITEMS IN ARRAY                       TPD00058
       ARS     15                                                       TPD00059
       LAS     ATSXZ         IS THIS A TSX WITH A TAG OF   ZERO         TPD00060
       TRA     RESTOW        NO. SUPPLY LAST ARG. MAKE A O  NE          TPD00061
       TRA     *+2                                                      TPD00062
       TRA     RESTOW                                                   TPD00063
       CLA     4,2           NUMBER OF ITEMS IN ARRAY                   TPD00064
 STRSZ STA     LCSZE                                                    TPD00065
       CAL     TAPNU                                                    TPD00066
       NOP      INITIALLY=NOP, THEREAFTER A TRA TOSLR                   TPD00067
TOCALL TSX     **,4          A TSX $(STH) OR $(TSH)                     TPD00068
 LCFOR TSX     0,0,0  WILL GIVE ADDRESS OF FORMAT (STORED FOWARDS)      TPD00069
 TOSLR TSX     **,4          A TSX $(SLO) OR $(SLI)                     TPD00070
 LCARY PZE     **            LOC. + 1 OF ARRAY                          TPD00071
 LCSZE PZE     **            SIZE OF RRAY                               TPD00072
       CLA     TTOSLR           A TRA TOSLR                             TPD00073
       STO     TOCALL-1      IF MORE ARGUMENTS SKIP THE TSX TO CALL.PROGTPD00074
       TXI     TNARG,2,-2    PICK UP NEXT ARGUMENTS                     TPD00075
       REM                                                              TPD00076
RESTOW TXI     *+1,2,1       IF LAST ARG. NOT GIVEN SUPPLY A ONE AND ADJTPD00077
       CLA     AONE          UST INDEX 2 FOR PROPER RETURN              TPD00078
       TRA     STRSZ                                                    TPD00079
       REM                                                              TPD00080
RESTOR TXL     NOLIST,1,SAVER                                           TPD00081
       TSX     **,4                                                     TPD00082
       STZ     LCARY                                                    TPD00083
 SAV1  AXT     **,1                                                     TPD00084
       PXA     0,2                                                      TPD00085
 SAV2  AXT     **,2                                                     TPD00086
       PAX     0,4                                                      TPD00087
       TRA     3,4                                                      TPD00088
       REM                                                              TPD00089
 AONE  PZE     1,0,0                                                    TPD00090
*                                 TOOK OUT SYMBOLIC LOC. ONEDC          TPD00091
 ATSXZ OCT     0074000                                                  TPD00092
 TAPNU PZE                                                              TPD00093
 ATSLI TSX     $(SLI),4                                                 TPD00094
 ATSLO TSX     $(SLO),4                                                 TPD00095
 ATRTN TSX     $(RTN),4                                                 TPD00096
 ATFIL TSX     $(FIL),4                                                 TPD00097
 ATSTH TSX     $(STH),4                                                 TPD00098
 ATTSH TSX     $(TSH),4                                                 TPD00099
TTOSLR TRA     TOSLR                                                    TPD00100
ATREST TRA     RESTOR+2                                                 TPD00101
 ANOP  NOP                                                              TPD00102
*                                                                       TPD00103
NOLIST TXI     *+1,1,1                                                  TPD00104
       CAL     RESTOR+1                                                 TPD00105
       SLW     TOSLR                                                    TPD00106
       CAL     ATREST                                                   TPD00107
       SLW     LCARY                                                    TPD00108
       TRA     STRSZ+1                                                  TPD00109
       END                                                              TPD00110
 THE FOLLOWING TWO CARDS SHOULD BE SUBSTITUTED IN THE DECK IF ASSEMBLY *TPD00111
  IS MADE WITH A SYSTEM WHICH DOES NOT CONTAIN THE STANDARD ERROR PRO- *TPD00112
 CEDURE.  THE PROGRAM STORES INDEX 4 IN THE PLACE OCCUPIED BY THE PZE. *TPD00113
       PZE       TO BE USED IF STANDARD ERROR NOT IN SYSTEM.   NUTPD020 TPD00114
       BCI     1,NUTPD   USE IF STANDARD ERROR NOT IN SYSTEM  NUTPD021  TPD00115
**************        LAST CARD NUTPD                                  *TPD00116
